title: Workspace after a restart, on the data of part 1 (FAILS under the stock runner: it wipes the work folder; needs a runner that keeps it)
expect-log: scanned 'git-history'
expect-log: scanned 'rust-small'
forbid-log: scanned 'plain'

wait 4000
mark after-restart
wait 600
left files
wait 700
mark after-restart-files
wait 600
quit
